  "7575d8a8-218e-4581-9aeb-2a1fac09c929"],
 "\[LineSeparator]gives a net classifying a list of author entities \
'authorL', embedding titles in dimension dim[[1]],abstracts in dimension \
dim[[2]], (optional) introductions in dimension dim[[4]],catenate them and \
later passing them into a linear layer with dimension dim[[3]], with dropout \
ratio 'drop'; \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"8b1b7c23-2331-4490-9b75-db7437e47f81"],
