passing them into a linear layer with dimension dim[[3]],with dropout ratio \
'drop'; \n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"511641d3-3795-407b-a7e5-161f5c3870c5"],
 Cell[BoxData[
