Cell["\<\
This simple recurrent neural network for classifications of ArXiv authors \
uses essentially a pair of LongShortMemoryLayer on titles and abstracts \
embedded with their own vocabularies, with before them a DropoutLayer for \
regularization with default drop ratio set at 0.9. Then a NetGraph combines \
them with CatenateLayer, allow an intermediate LinearLayer and finally output \
the classification probabilities through SoftmaxLayer. \
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.931234283362441*^9, 3.931234390544943*^9}, {
  3.931237729727355*^9, 3.931237828021842*^9}},
 CellID->978645619,ExpressionUUID->"4120dfd0-38cb-47be-98c8-0a3353686a74"]
}, Open  ]],

